<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>FOOTBALL PRO — Plataforma de Treinamento</title>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.0/dist/chart.umd.min.js"></script>
<style>
  :root{
    --bg-dark:#0a0e1a;
    --bg-panel:#111827;
    --bg-card:#1a2235;
    --bg-card-hover:#222b42;
    --neon:#39ff14;
    --neon-soft:#2ecc71;
    --neon-dim:rgba(57,255,20,.15);
    --text:#ffffff;
    --text-dim:#9ca3af;
    --text-muted:#6b7280;
    --border:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
    --danger:#ef4444;
    --warning:#f59e0b;
    --info:#3b82f6;
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:'Segoe UI',system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif}
  body{background:var(--bg-dark);color:var(--text);min-height:100vh;overflow-x:hidden}
  
  /* LAYOUT */
  .app{display:grid;grid-template-columns:240px 1fr;min-height:100vh}
  
  /* SIDEBAR */
  .sidebar{
    background:linear-gradient(180deg,#0d1220 0%,#0a0e1a 100%);
    border-right:1px solid var(--border);
    padding:24px 16px;
    position:sticky;top:0;height:100vh;
    display:flex;flex-direction:column;
  }
  .logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:40px;padding:0 8px}
  .logo-icon{
    width:40px;height:40px;
    background:radial-gradient(circle,var(--neon) 0%,transparent 70%);
    border-radius:50%;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    font-size:22px;
  }
  .logo-text{font-weight:800;font-size:18px;letter-spacing:1px}
  .logo-text span{color:var(--neon)}
  
  .nav{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;flex:1}
  .nav-item{
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;
    padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;
    color:var(--text-dim);cursor:pointer;
    transition:all .2s;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;
  }
  .nav-item:hover{background:var(--bg-card);color:var(--text)}
  .nav-item.active{
    background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--neon-dim),transparent);
    color:var(--neon);border-left:3px solid var(--neon);
  }
  .nav-icon{font-size:18px;width:24px;text-align:center}
  
  .sidebar-footer{
    margin-top:auto;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;
  }
  .user-avatar{
    width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--neon),var(--neon-soft));
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    font-weight:700;color:#000;font-size:16px;
  }
  .user-info{flex:1}
  .user-name{font-weight:600;font-size:14px}
  .user-role{font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted)}
  
  /* MAIN CONTENT */
  .main{padding:32px;overflow-y:auto;height:100vh}
  .page{display:none;animation:fadeIn .3s ease}
  .page.active{display:block}
  @keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}
  
  .header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:32px}
  .page-title{font-size:28px;font-weight:700}
  .page-title span{color:var(--neon)}
  
  /* CARDS & GRID */
  .grid{display:grid;gap:20px}
  .grid-2{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .grid-3{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
  .grid-4{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}
  
  .card{
    background:var(--bg-card);border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:16px;padding:24px;transition:all .2s;
  }
  .card:hover{border-color:var(--neon);transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}
  .card-title{font-size:16px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
  .card-title .icon{color:var(--neon)}
  
  /* HERO SECTION */
  .hero{
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(57,255,20,.1) 0%,rgba(10,14,26,0) 100%);
    border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;
    padding:32px;margin-bottom:32px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;
  }
  .hero::before{
    content:'';position:absolute;top:-50%;right:-20%;
    width:400px;height:400px;background:radial-gradient(circle,var(--neon-dim) 0%,transparent 70%);
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .hero-greeting{font-size:14px;color:var(--text-dim);margin-bottom:8px}
  .hero-title{font-size:32px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:16px;line-height:1.2}
  .hero-title span{color:var(--neon)}
  .hero-stats{display:flex;gap:24px;margin-top:24px}
  .stat-item{text-align:center}
  .stat-value{font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:var(--neon)}
  .stat-label{font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:4px}
  
  /* PROGRESS BAR */
  .progress-container{margin-top:16px}
  .progress-header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--text-dim)}
  .progress-bar{
    height:8px;background:var(--bg-dark);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;
  }
  .progress-fill{
    height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--neon),var(--neon-soft));
    border-radius:4px;transition:width .5s ease;
  }
  
  /* BUTTONS */
  .btn{
    padding:10px 20px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;
    cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s;border:none;display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;gap:8px;
  }
  .btn-primary{
    background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--neon),var(--neon-soft));
    color:#000;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover{opacity:.9;transform:scale(1.02)}
  .btn-secondary{
    background:var(--bg-card);color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .btn-secondary:hover{border-color:var(--neon);color:var(--neon)}
  .btn-danger{background:var(--danger);color:#fff}
  .btn-sm{padding:6px 12px;font-size:12px}
  
  /* TRAINING CARDS */
  .training-card{
    background:var(--bg-card);border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:16px;padding:20px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s;
    display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;
  }
  .training-card:hover{
    border-color:var(--neon);transform:translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(57,255,20,.1);
  }
  .training-icon{
    width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:12px;
    background:var(--neon-dim);display:flex;align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;font-size:24px;
  }
  .training-name{font-weight:600;font-size:16px}
  .training-desc{font-size:13px;color:var(--text-dim);line-height:1.5;flex:1}
  .training-meta{
    display:flex;gap:12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);
    padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .training-meta span{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px}
  
  /* FILTERS */
  .filters{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:24px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .filter-btn{
    padding:8px 16px;border-radius:20px;background:var(--bg-card);
    border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text-dim);
    cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s;font-size:13px;
  }
  .filter-btn:hover,.filter-btn.active{
    background:var(--neon-dim);border-color:var(--neon);color:var(--neon);
  }
  
  /* EXERCISE DETAIL */
  .exercise-hero{
    background:var(--bg-card);border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:20px;padding:32px;margin-bottom:24px;
  }
  .exercise-hero h2{font-size:28px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px}
  .exercise-hero p{color:var(--text-dim);font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:24px}
  .exercise-meta{display:flex;gap:20px;margin-top:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;position:relative}
  .exercise-meta .meta-item{
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;
    padding:6px 12px;background:var(--bg-dark);
    border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;
  }
  .exercise-meta .meta-item strong{color:var(--neon)}
  
  .video-placeholder{
    background:#000;border-radius:12px;
    height:300px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    color:var(--text-dim);font-size:14px;
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    margin-bottom:20px;
  }
  
  /* ADMIN */
  .admin-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px;margin-bottom:32px}
  .stat-card{
    background:var(--bg-card);border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:16px;padding:24px;text-align:center;
  }
  .stat-card .value{font-size:32px;font-weight:700;color:var(--neon);margin-bottom:8px}
  .stat-card .label{font-size:14px;color:var(--text-dim)}
  
  /* TABLES */
  .table-container{overflow-x:auto;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--border)}
  table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px}
  th{
    background:var(--bg-dark);padding:16px;text-align:left;
    font-weight:600;color:var(--text-dim);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
  }
  td{
    padding:16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
    color:var(--text);
  }
  tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}
  tr:hover td{background:var(--bg-card-hover)}
  
  .badge{
    padding:4px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;
    display:inline-block;
  }
  .badge-success{background:rgba(46,204,113,.15);color:var(--neon-soft)}
  .badge-warning{background:rgba(245,158,11,.15);color:var(--warning)}
  .badge-danger{background:rgba(239,68,68,.15);color:var(--danger)}
  .badge-info{background:rgba(59,130,246,.15);color:var(--info)}
  
  /* MODALS */
  .modal{
    position:fixed;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;
    background:rgba(0,0,0,.8);backdrop-filter:blur(4px);
    display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:1000;
  }
  .modal.active{display:flex}
  .modal-content{
    background:var(--bg-panel);border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:20px;padding:32px;width:90%;max-width:500px;
    animation:modalIn .3s ease;
  }
  @keyframes modalIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale(.95)}to{opacity:1;transform:scale(1)}}
  .modal-header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:24px}
  .modal-title{font-size:20px;font-weight:700}
  .modal-close{
    width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--bg-card);
    border:none;color:var(--text);cursor:pointer;display:flex;
    align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:18px;
  }
  .modal-close:hover{background:var(--danger);color:#fff}
  
  /* FORMS */
  .form-group{margin-bottom:20px}
  .form-group label{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--text-dim)}
  .form-control{
    width:100%;padding:12px 16px;background:var(--bg-dark);
    border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;
    color:var(--text);font-size:14px;transition:all .2s;
  }
  .form-control:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--neon);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--neon-dim)}
  textarea.form-control{min-height:100px;resize:vertical}
  
  /* ACHIEVEMENTS */
  .achievement-card{
    background:var(--bg-card);border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:16px;padding:20px;text-align:center;
    transition:all .2s;position:relative;overflow:hidden;
  }
  .achievement-card.unlocked{border-color:var(--warning)}
  .achievement-card.unlocked::before{
    content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:3px;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--warning),#fbbf24);
  }
  .achievement-card.locked{opacity:.5;filter:grayscale(1)}
  .achievement-icon{font-size:32px;margin-bottom:12px}
  .achievement-name{font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:4px}
  .achievement-desc{font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted)}
  
  /* MOBILE */
  .mobile-menu-btn{
    display:none;position:fixed;top:16px;left:16px;z-index:100;
    width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--bg-card);
    border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);cursor:pointer;
    align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:20px;
  }
  
  @media(max-width:1024px){
    .app{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .sidebar{
      position:fixed;left:-100%;top:0;width:280px;z-index:99;
      transition:left .3s ease;
    }
    .sidebar.open{left:0}
    .mobile-menu-btn{display:flex}
    .main{padding:24px 16px;padding-top:72px}
    .grid-2,.grid-3,.grid-4{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .admin-stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
    .hero-stats{flex-wrap:wrap}
  }
  
  /* UTILS */
  .text-neon{color:var(--neon)}
  .text-dim{color:var(--text-dim)}
  .text-muted{color:var(--text-muted)}
  .mt-2{margin-top:8px}
  .mt-4{margin-top:16px}
  .mb-2{margin-bottom:8px}
  .mb-4{margin-bottom:16px}
  .flex{display:flex}
  .flex-between{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
  .gap-2{gap:8px}
  .gap-4{gap:16px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<button class="mobile-menu-btn" onclick="document.querySelector('.sidebar').classList.toggle('open')">☰</button>

<div class="app">
  <!-- SIDEBAR -->
  <aside class="sidebar">
    <div class="logo">
      <div class="logo-icon">⚽</div>
      <div class="logo-text">FOOTBALL<span>PRO</span></div>
    </div>
    
    <nav class="nav">
      <div class="nav-item active" data-page="inicio">
        <span class="nav-icon">🏠</span> Início
      </div>
      <div class="nav-item" data-page="treinos">
        <span class="nav-icon">📋</span> Treinos
      </div>
      <div class="nav-item" data-page="perfil">
        <span class="nav-icon">👤</span> Meu Perfil
      </div>
      <div class="nav-item" data-page="desempenho">
        <span class="nav-icon">📊</span> Desempenho
      </div>
      <div class="nav-item" data-page="conquistas">
        <span class="nav-icon">🏆</span> Conquistas
      </div>
      <div class="nav-item" data-page="avaliacao">
        <span class="nav-icon">⭐</span> Avaliação
      </div>
      <div class="nav-item" data-page="admin">
        <span class="nav-icon">⚙️</span> Administração
      </div>
      <div class="nav-item" data-page="configuracoes">
        <span class="nav-icon">🔧</span> Configurações
      </div>
    </nav>
    
    <div class="sidebar-footer">
      <div class="user-avatar">L</div>
      <div class="user-info">
        <div class="user-name">Lucas Mendes</div>
        <div class="user-role">Atleta · Nível 5</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </aside>

  <!-- MAIN CONTENT -->
  <main class="main">
    <!-- INÍCIO -->
    <section class="page active" id="page-inicio">
      <div class="hero">
        <div class="hero-greeting">Olá, Lucas! Continue evoluindo em seus treinos</div>
        <div class="hero-title">EVOLUA. TREINE. <span>CONQUISTE.</span></div>
        <p style="color:var(--text-dim);max-width:600px;margin-bottom:24px">
          Você está indo muito bem! Foque em melhorar seus atributos de finalização e velocidade para alcançar o próximo nível.
        </p>
        
        <div class="progress-container" style="max-width:400px">
          <div class="progress-header">
            <span>Nível 5</span>
            <span>520 / 800 XP</span>
          </div>
          <div class="progress-bar">
            <div class="progress-fill" style="width:65%"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="hero-stats">
          <div class="stat-item">
            <div class="stat-value">78%</div>
            <div class="stat-label">Desempenho Geral</div>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-item">
            <div class="stat-value">47</div>
            <div class="stat-label">Treinos Concluídos</div>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-item">
            <div class="stat-value text-neon">85</div>
            <div class="stat-label">Destaque: Drible</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex-between mb-4">
        <h3 style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700">🎯 Próximo Desafio</h3>
        <button class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" onclick="navigateTo('treinos')">Ver todos →</button>
      </div>
      
      <div class="card" style="border-left:3px solid var(--neon);margin-bottom:32px">
        <div class="flex-between">
          <div>
            <div style="font-weight:600;font-size:16px;margin-bottom:8px">Finalização Precisa</div>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text-dim)">Complete 3 treinos de finalização nível médio para desbloquear o desafio avançado.</div>
            <div class="progress-container" style="max-width:300px;margin-top:12px">
              <div class="progress-header">
                <span>Progresso</span>
                <span>1 / 3</span>
              </div>
              <div class="progress-bar">
                <div class="progress-fill" style="width:33%"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="navigateTo('treinos')">Iniciar ▶</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex-between mb-4">
        <h3 style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700">⭐ Treinamentos Recomendados</h3>
        <button class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" onclick="navigateTo('treinos')">Ver todos →</button>
      </div>
      
      <div class="grid grid-3" id="recommendedTrainings"></div>
    </section>

    <!-- TREINOS -->
    <section class="page" id="page-treinos">
      <div class="header">
        <div class="page-title">Catálogo de <span>Treinamentos</span></div>
      </div>
      
      <p style="color:var(--text-dim);margin-bottom:24px">Explore exercícios por categoria, modalidade e dificuldade</p>
      
      <div class="filters">
        <button class="filter-btn active" data-filter="todos">Todos</button>
        <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="academia">🏋️ Academia</button>
        <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="campo">⚽ Campo</button>
        <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="casa">🏠 Casa</button>
        <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="tecnico">Técnico</button>
        <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="fisico">Físico</button>
        <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="tatico">Tático</button>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-3" id="trainingsCatalog"></div>
    </section>

    <!-- EXERCÍCIO INDIVIDUAL -->
    <section class="page" id="page-exercicio">
      <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="navigateTo('treinos')" style="margin-bottom:16px">← Voltar ao catálogo</button>
      
      <div class="exercise-hero">
        <h2 id="exName">Drible em Zigue-Zague</h2>
        <p id="exDesc">Desenvolva sua capacidade de drible com mudanças de direção em alta velocidade.</p>
        <div class="exercise-meta">
          <div class="meta-item">📂 <strong id="exModality">Campo</strong></div>
          <div class="meta-item">🎯 <strong id="exSkill">Drible / Finta</strong></div>
          <div class="meta-item">⚡ <strong id="exDifficulty">Médio</strong></div>
          <div class="meta-item">⏱️ <strong id="exDuration">10 min</strong></div>
          <div class="meta-item">🏷️ <strong id="exCategory">Técnico & Coordenativo</strong></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-2">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:12px"><span class="icon">🎬</span> Vídeo Demonstrativo</div>
          <div class="video-placeholder" id="exVideo">
            ▶️ Vídeo do YouTube/Instagram incorporado aqui<br>
            <small style="margin-top:8px;display:block">(Link cadastrado pelo administrador)</small>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:12px"><span class="icon">📋</span> Instruções</div>
          <ul style="color:var(--text-dim);font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;padding-left:20px">
            <li>Posicione 5 cones em linha reta com 1m de distância.</li>
            <li>Conduza a bola em zigue-zague usando a parte interna e externa do pé.</li>
            <li>Mantenha a cabeça levantada o máximo possível.</li>
            <li>Acelere após o último cone e finalize.</li>
            <li>Repita 5 vezes, alternando o pé dominante.</li>
          </ul>
          
          <div style="margin-top:20px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)">
            <div class="card-title"><span class="icon">✅</span> Critérios de Conclusão</div>
            <ul style="color:var(--text-dim);font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;padding-left:20px">
              <li>Completar 5 repetições sem perder o controle da bola</li>
              <li>Manter tempo médio abaixo de 12s por repetição</li>
              <li>Cabeça levantada em pelo menos 3 das 5 repetições</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          
          <div style="margin-top:20px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)">
            <div class="card-title"><span class="icon">📊</span> Critérios de Avaliação</div>
            <ul style="color:var(--text-dim);font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;padding-left:20px">
              <li><strong>Nível 1:</strong> Executa em baixa velocidade, sem adversário</li>
              <li><strong>Nível 2:</strong> Aplica em velocidade moderada, dificuldade em acelerar após</li>
              <li><strong>Nível 3:</strong> Desequilibra o marcador e conecta com passe/finalização</li>
